# Plume – production environment variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in every value before running docker compose.
# Never commit the real .env to source control.
#
# The Go licensing/checkout backend has been decommissioned — Plume is now a
# fully free plugin with no license server. This file is a placeholder until
# apps/web's checkout UI is removed (tracked separately); add web-frontend-only
# variables here as they're introduced.
